{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "拒绝回答的问题  (Questions Declined)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bianbian": "边边",
    "stella": "斯戴拉",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 7 of Behind the Scenes. Reporter Bianbian visits Xingtian to interview public-relations director Stella about how Xingtian turned its public feud with Xin Huimei into a triumph. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐，幸会啊，我就是传说中的边边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "凯文说你给星天解决了那件事，也算省了我公关部的麻烦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他让我照应你，他也不想想，这麻烦本来就是你给的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "照您这意思，我这篇报道就写不成了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你想多了，做我们公关部的本来就要以媒体关系为本，怎么能拒绝记者呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "况且你也已经签了合同了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "我拒绝的内容你不能发，问题我也可以拒绝回答，对吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "没错，您不会打算让我整篇报道都发不出去吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那就看你的了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我这回很有诚意，是想好好夸夸你们星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "辛惠美原本是你们的对头，可没想到结局大反转，这是危机公关的最高境界。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "您是公关总监，这么大的公关事件，难道不是您操控的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这属于拒绝回答的问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐，请喝咖啡。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐，幸会啊，我就是传说中的边边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nice to meet you, Stella; I am the legendary Bianbian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "凯文说你给星天解决了那件事，也算省了我公关部的麻烦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen says you settled that matter for Xingtian and saved my PR department trouble.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他让我照应你，他也不想想，这麻烦本来就是你给的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He asked me to look after you, forgetting that you caused that trouble in the first place.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "照您这意思，我这篇报道就写不成了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By what you mean, will I not be able to write this article after all?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你想多了，做我们公关部的本来就要以媒体关系为本，怎么能拒绝记者呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are overthinking it; PR is built on media relations, so how could we turn away a reporter?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "况且你也已经签了合同了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides, you have already signed the agreement.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "我拒绝的内容你不能发，问题我也可以拒绝回答，对吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You cannot publish content I veto, and I may also decline to answer questions, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "没错，您不会打算让我整篇报道都发不出去吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Quite right; surely you do not plan to block my entire article from going out?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那就看你的了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That will depend on you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我这回很有诚意，是想好好夸夸你们星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I came in good faith this time, hoping to give Xingtian proper praise.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "辛惠美原本是你们的对头，可没想到结局大反转，这是危机公关的最高境界。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xin Huimei used to be your rival, yet the ending turned right around — peak crisis PR.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "您是公关总监，这么大的公关事件，难道不是您操控的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are PR director; was a PR event this big not orchestrated by you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这属于拒绝回答的问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That falls under questions I decline to answer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐，请喝咖啡。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stella, please have your coffee.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐，幸会啊，我就是传说中的边边。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "凯文说你给星天解决了那件事，也算省了我公关部的麻烦。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他让我照应你，他也不想想，这麻烦本来就是你给的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "照您这意思，我这篇报道就写不成了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "你想多了，做我们公关部的本来就要以媒体关系为本，怎么能拒绝记者呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "况且你也已经签了合同了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "我拒绝的内容你不能发，问题我也可以拒绝回答，对吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "没错，您不会打算让我整篇报道都发不出去吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那就看你的了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我这回很有诚意，是想好好夸夸你们星天。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "辛惠美原本是你们的对头，可没想到结局大反转，这是危机公关的最高境界。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "您是公关总监，这么大的公关事件，难道不是您操控的？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这属于拒绝回答的问题。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐，请喝咖啡。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stella coolly uses her contractual veto to shut down Bianbian's probing question just as Bu Xiaogu steps in with coffee. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
